{
  "$comment": "The live smoke checks, in order: sproutsdata-py scripts/smoke.py and sproutsdata-js scripts/smoke-live.mjs each implement exactly these names and refuse to run if a name is missing or extra, so the two report the same checks against the same deployment. `billed` marks a check that spends credits on a live key (a test key's calls are free).",
